actions: log | f | log: page down | actions: filter | f opens the filter; pgdown still pages down
actions: log | h | log: left | actions: pane left | h and l move between the panes; the arrows still scroll the log
actions: log | l | log: right | actions: pane right | h and l move between the panes; the arrows still scroll the log
